Third-party software installed into images
------------------------------------------

The image built from `cuda/Dockerfile.vllm-v100` (`cuda12.8-v100-vllm1cat1.5.1`)
downloads and installs the released 1Cat-vLLM wheel at build time, unmodified:

    1Cat-vLLM
    https://github.com/1CatAI/1Cat-vLLM
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The image carries the license at `/opt/gpuworks/licenses/1Cat-vLLM.Apache-2.0.txt`
(a copy of licenses/Apache-2.0.txt).

Image labels and user-visible strings
-------------------------------------

Image labels are `io.gpuworks.*` / `org.opencontainers.image.vendor=gpuworks`,
and image tags carry no third-party project name. Attribution lives in this
source tree and in this file.
